# Roadmap OS needs NO environment variables in this version.
# Progress is stored in the browser, and the curriculum ships as static JSON in data/.
#
# The next stage adds cloud sync (Supabase auth and database). It will need:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
#
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development and add the same values in
# Vercel (Project Settings > Environment Variables). Never commit .env.local.
